<title>ARGENTINA: Chile March trade surplus $193 mln - Central Bank.</title>
<headline>Chile March trade surplus $193 mln - Central Bank.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile ran up a $193 million trade surplus in March, the Central Bank said Wednesday.</p>
<p>March exports totaled $1.59 billion and imports were $1.40 billion, it said.</p>
</text>
